Premise: index is within valid range. What is valid range for add(int, Object) in ArrayList? Usually 0 <= index && index <= size(). Since insertion at size allowed (append). But comment says "within the valid range". We'll assert index >=0 && index <= \old(this.size()) . But after insertion, size increased by 1, so old size is \old(this.size()). So condition: index >=0 && index <= \old(this.size()).

Thus final assert:

assert (index >= 0 && index <= \old(this.size())) => (\forall int i; index <= i && i < \old(this.size()); ( \old(this.get(i)) == null ? this.get(i+1) == null : this.get(i+1).equals(\old(this.get(i))) ));

